Z||000001||Philphine||10-15-2001||09:30 PM||||i got dtm's for my coupe. angled duals that i paid about $80 for (two tips, each is a dual outlet like a gt) local shop put them on for $20. for the gt i just got i ground off the megaphone part and got 4 tips i liked at autozone and some reducers and welded them on myself (still need to do one side). buying four tips individually is kind of costly depending on what you like, but there are more styles to chose from. tips and reducers was about $115. ||||reg||1
